# @file Godolphin Barb - Recruitment
# @author フィンランド
# @author Katze (translator)
recruit:
  title: Ever Changing, Shaped by Your Gaze
  lines:
    - A new day, a new beginning.
    - When %YOU% opened the training room door, someone was already inside.
    - A breeze through the window stirred her long aqua hair as she leaned against the frame, bathed in the soft morning light.
    - color: %COLOR%
      content:
        - fontWeight: bold
          content: ???
        - 「My, hard at work again today, %CALLNAME%.」
    - Gone was the Greek robe that marked her as a Goddess. Dressed in a blue tracksuit, she looked no different from any ordinary Umamusume.
    - But those gently curved, ever-smiling eyes, filled with a boundless, waterlike tenderness, made %YOU% recognize her at once.
    - The academy's smiling Goddess with a vessel, the mist-veiled visitor from the dream, and the Umamusume before them became one.
    - color: %COLOR%
      content:
        - fontWeight: bold
          content: %CHARA%
        - 「Being a trainer is hard, is it not? Guiding %UMA% and showing %THEY% the way... You have done so much for them.」
    - color: %COLOR%
      content:
        - fontWeight: bold
          content: %CHARA%
        - 「But from now on, I will be watching over you.」
    - She stepped out of the golden morning light and approached %YOU%, like a divine being descending from another world.
    - color: %COLOR%
      content:
        - fontWeight: bold
          content: %CHARA%
        - 「I look forward to our time together.」
